0.2.0 (2026-10-30)
  Read MySQL archives through a weewx.conf binding into a consistent SQLite snapshot.
  Add copy-to-mysql, which loads a corrected copy into a new, empty MySQL database.
  MySQL backups go beside weewx.conf.

0.1.1 (2026-10-29)
  First standalone release.
  Inspect field coverage, archive alignment and example rows from a SQLite snapshot.
  Preview per-field aggregation and record transfers with conflict checks.
  Save verified permanent backups before exporting corrected copies.
  Rebuild affected scalar daily summaries while preserving other observations.
  Include a dark web interface, paginated previews and standalone HTML/JSON reports.
